<title>USA: TABLE-Northern States Power Co Q2 net off.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Northern States Power Co Q2 net off.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.23		    $0.59</p>
<p> Net			 18,300		   43,400</p>
<p> Revs		     594,300		  592,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  68,871		   68,661</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 1997 net is after non-recurring merger costs that decreased earnings by $17.1 million, or $0.25 a share.</p>
<p>Excluding merger costs, earnings from ongoing operations were $0.48 a share vs $0.59.</p>
<p>Q2 1997 net is preferred stock dividends of $2.4 million vs $3.1 million.</p>
<p>		     SIX MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.13		    $1.53</p>
<p> Net			 84,000		  110,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,336,800		1,311,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  68,849		   68,486</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Excluding merger costs, 1997 six-month earnings from ongoing operations were $1.38 a share vs $1.53.</p>
<p>Six-month 1997 net is before $6.3 million in preferred stock dividends vs $6.1 million.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
